Package: refmatR
Title: Search and Retrieve Reference Matrices from RefmatDB
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Kaufman", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mkaufman@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: A read-only client for RefmatDB. Searches reference metadata and
    cell types, downloads original files with SHA-256 verification, and imports
    numeric genes-by-cell-type matrices for downstream annotation with clustifyr.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: httr2 (>= 1.0.0), digest, utils
Suggests: clustifyr
